---
// A continuously scrolling client list. Brands with a logo file render as a
// mark; the rest render as their name set in the site's own type, so the
// parade is complete rather than only showing whichever logos turned up.
//
// Logos are pre-processed to black-on-transparent silhouettes at 160px tall,
// trimmed to the ink. One asset then works in both themes — dark theme inverts
// it — which colour logos cannot do without disappearing against one
// background or the other.
//
// `href` points at the project done for that client where one exists. The
// marquee pauses on hover so those are actually clickable.
type Client = { name: string; logo?: string; href?: string };

// Real intrinsic sizes, so the browser reserves the correct box before the
// image decodes. A wrong or missing size reflows the track mid-animation.
